  "body": "Part of #4023. Builds on K0 and #3750.\n\n## What to do\n\nMake load control one stage that changes a guide curve.\n\n- Modes: none, trochoidal, constant engagement.\n- Measure the engagement on the current stock.\n- Prevent a cut above the limit, or name it on the status line.\n- Never use a fallback without a message.\n\n## Reports that this step covers\n\n#3932, #3933 and #3849. PR #4008 is open for #3849; this step does not replace that work.\n\n## Done means\n\nEach strategy with load control uses this stage, and the pins of the reports are green.\n",
